From 43743adf9e41f0bea4c34e5263cccd611c12e280 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 12:36:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Make experience cards stack on scroll

Each job card now pins at the top of the viewport as you scroll, then
the next card slides up to cover it, instead of both cards being
statically listed one after another.

Experience no longer participates in the outer section-level sticky
stack, since nesting position:sticky inside an already-stuck sticky
ancestor prevented the inner cards from sticking independently.
---
 .../home/accordion/accordion-experience.tsx   | 79 ++++++++++---------
 components/home/accordion/accordion.tsx       | 13 ++-
 2 files changed, 52 insertions(+), 40 deletions(-)

diff --git a/components/home/accordion/accordion-experience.tsx b/components/home/accordion/accordion-experience.tsx
index f883919..1d8589f 100644
